# Airflow

DAGs: `orchestration/airflow/dags/`. Plugins: `orchestration/airflow/plugins/`.

## Current DAGs

| DAG | Owns |
|---|---|
| `warehouse_daily_batch_pipeline` | POS Parquet, staging/intermediate, **`marts.finance`**, ANALYZE, GE |
| `marketing_hourly_customer_360_pipeline` | staging/intermediate + **`marts.marketing`** (identity, sessions, RFM, C360) |
| `streaming_manual_flink_jobs` | EMR Flink submit + duplicate-run guard |
| `catalog_bihourly_product_scd2_refresh` | `dim_product` SCD2 |
| `quality_hourly_ge_checkpoint` | Hourly GE `gold_layer_daily` |
| `lakehouse_daily_iceberg_maintenance` | Iceberg compaction / snapshot expiry |

Do not dual-build `marts.marketing` on the daily warehouse DAG.

## Conventions

- Filename/DAG ID: `{domain}_{frequency}_{description}`.
- `doc_md`, `catchup=False`, retries, `email_on_failure=True`.
- Infra endpoints via Airflow Variables — no hardcoded ARNs/passwords/endpoints.
- Never template a secret into a command: Jinja renders `{{ var.value.* }}` into
  the stored command, the Rendered Template tab, and task logs. Bash tasks wrap
  with `dbt_bash_with_metadata` / `ge_bash_with_metadata`, which export
  `RS_SECRET_ARN` and fetch the password in the task shell; Python tasks call
  `metadata_airflow.redshift_password()`. Enforced by `tests/unit/test_dag_contract.py`.
- Prefer task factories (`_dbt_step`, `_flink_step`).
- Idempotency: no duplicate Flink submits; partition-safe POS; dbt `delete+insert` uniqueness.

Reference: `docs/runbooks/dag-review-checklist.md`.
